ne 22, 1998 contact : eugene charniak e-mail ec @ cs. brown. edu address : before february 1, 1998 and after june 1, 1998 department of computer science brown university providence ri 02912-1910 address : from february 1, 1998 until june 1, 1998 department of computer science johns hopkins university neb 224, 3400 n. charles street baltimore, md 21218-2694",
